OL,3,ATwo injured in stabbing attack at
OL,4,ACanada Sikh temple
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after injuring
OL,7,Ftwo people in an early morning stabbing
OL,8,Fattack at a Sikh temple in Edmonton,
OL,9,FCanada, police said.
OL,11,FOfficials said the attack inside the
OL,12,Fsprawling Nanaksar Gurdwara unfolded
OL,13,Faround 05:00 local time (12:00 BST) on
OL,14,FFriday morning. Police did not identify
OL,15,Fthe suspect, nor did they specify a
OL,16,Fmotive.
OL,18,FThe attack comes after police confirmed
OL,19,Flast week that they were investigating
OL,20,Fthreatening calls made to two Sikh
OL,21,Fgurdwaras in Calgary, two hours south
OL,22,Fof where Friday's attack took place.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
