OL,3,ATwo injured in stabbing attack at
OL,4,ACanada Sikh temple
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe World Sikh Organization, based in
OL,7,FCanada, has said the attack is deeply
OL,8,Ftroubling and has occurred against the
OL,9,Fbackdrop of rising anti-Sikh hate
OL,10,Facross the country.
